mage 20.png", "id": "460727386930428", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031655_460727390263761_9081801733047056990_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jqTwyD4N054Q7kNvwHpRaXv&_nc_oc=AdrVi4ec6m2EhDoS616qr_hPwlw1ZxMhq_QRh2eNpeSorpgiWQ3_xMxzkvH4TD3OaU4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFCReiRlMq1y8woZMEeZJPCXjZoA8b7JprNdvENda1gzQ&oe=6A7DA39C"}, {"file_name": "glow.png", "id": "1116003646903939", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974688_1116003650237272_6007306760773728309_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=acCW7plisZsQ7kNvwHhY93N&_nc_oc=AdonaIE7PHUX2DIrIw1HCxYM32gLk5u3J4EuExTxrg9p7OfuIij3kv8dmXyWnI1O4X4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHOnKtvHvbEIsnoladghYwJThkbFLqdyuKFCuC81jV7Eg&oe=6A7DC949"}, {"file_name": "glowwithenvironment.png", "id": "1113184757482952", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035308_1113184760816285_2144318049796039853_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LKp1ZumAOnwQ7kNvwGsc3VD&_nc_oc=AdokGA72VIJhTFFU71s2BSwzyGRtzGjLnIJfzTkA3qEhn2JiEsOG9b-1ky5nww0z6_8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFguLPkT1c4K8EbhF5Dsj5rmYeky5BtPSsYHWFDL-QCmg&oe=6A7DA813"}, {"file_name": "icons_2560.png", "id": "837700041651002", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031639_837700044984335_7632039083082594382_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=meWTUT5_9IQQ7kNvwEAGgG2&_nc_oc=Adq0ddDB26u7I_d1syClhLh19sNOG-asbTulxtVmD9o-Icr20qoF91Z2mXsDDTHvhzM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHb6wun93nSpTeUQnfyJ1zi5bk2DRMAa4ehyTnF9MLx3g&oe=6A7D9AD2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape (2).png", "id": "1728150691275503", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035347_1728150694608836_5619279543287794777_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0bIPo5RGTZoQ7kNvwH_4E9p&_nc_oc=AdrpnKW5V3IbJsn1qixemUuUwVU6b_nsF7KO29AY6J2LELWWH3ZA4wVFaUs5RrZ28ug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH05Uqkrg6rygGF9iEIblSAWl8ND3K3JnIFqr3w8puNfg&oe=6A7DC30D"}, "display_name": "Spatial TV", "keywords": ["Disney", "Video", "Max", "YouTube", "Hulu"], "long_description": "Spatial TV is the ultimate app to watch movies in VR. People love the amazing ambient light that transforms your home into a movie theater. \n\n**Dim your environment and immerse in the amazing lighting effect**\n{852842470242705}\n\n**Glow your screen**\n{871490895031711}\n\n**Supports YouTube, Disney+, HBO Max, Hulu, Apple TV+ and more**\n\nThere's also a built-in browser to access any video you love from the internet!\n\n{1152430492726135}\n\n**You will also love**\n\n- Optimized screen clarity with 3840 x 2160 super-sampled pixels per eye\n\n- Making the screen really huge and enjoying your favorite videos while lying back\n\n- Super flexible screen placement and intuitive design\n\n**Enjoy the breathtaking ambient light now!**\n\n{1150597832678777}\n\nNote: Netflix is not supported on Spatial TV yet\n", "short_description": "Spatial TV brings Real-time Lighting to your AR Movie experience\n\n- Lie down and enjoy your favorite video on a huge screen\n\n- Feel the magic of real-time screen lighting\n\n- Maximum sharpness with 3840 x 2160 super-sampled pixels\n\n- Supports YouTube, Plex, HBO Max, Hulu, Apple TV+, Disney+, Crunchyroll and more\n\n- Access any web-based content with the built-in browser \n\nNote: Netflix is not supported on Spatial TV yet\n\nFor support, please join our discord: https://discord.gg/G6J67kW2Vb"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://spatial-tv.app/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Interdime", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://spatial-tv.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfor